# Summary (key log deleted; only these codes kept)
# 1 synthetic Ctrl+F12 (send_key_state) did NOT fire a Ctrl+F12 binding; real press did.  => sent keys skip binds.
# 2 Super+click: Chrome ignores Super; holding a virtual Ctrl via send_key_state during a non-consuming click didn't help either.
# 3 close every window of a class via hl.dsp.window.close: works.
# 4 gestures: 3 up, 4 up/down, 4 sideways OK. Hyprland's "pinchin" fires on a spread and "pinchout" on a pinch (reversed). 5-finger: nothing.
# 5 Magic Keyboard fn+F3..F6 (xkb keycode / evdev): F3 128/KEY_SCALE, F4 225/KEY_SEARCH, F5 256/KEY_MICMUTE, F6 150/KEY_SLEEP (did not suspend). fn itself 472/KEY_FN.
